  * Outputs:
      * an *note ideal: (Macaulay2Doc)Ideal,, which represents Appell F1 (see
        https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Appell_series#Derivatives_and_
        differential_equations ) system of PDE's associated to the parameters
        a0, a1, a2, and a3.

Description
===========

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : w = {1,4/5,-2,3/2}                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|         4      3                                                            |
|o1 = {1, -, -2, -}                                                           |
|         5      2                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : I = AppellF1 w                                                          |
|                                                                             |
|               3  2    2           2  2               14 2     4             |
|o2 = ideal (- x Dx  - x y*Dx*Dy + x Dx  + x*y*Dx*Dy - --x Dx - -x*y*Dy +     |
|                                                       5       5             |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     3       4        2         3  2                2  2             3       |
|     -x*Dx - -x, - x*y Dx*Dy - y Dy  + x*y*Dx*Dy + y Dy  + 2x*y*Dx + -y*Dy + |
|     2       5                                                       2       |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|                                   4                                         |
|     2y, x*Dx*Dy - y*Dx*Dy + 2Dx + -Dy)                                      |
|                                   5                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Ideal of QQ[x, y, Dx, Dy]                                               |
