        length half the number of variables in the Weyl algebra
  * Outputs:
      * a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, containing monomials times
        logarithms in the variables

Description
===========

This routine returns the lead terms of the canonical series solutions of $I$
with respect to the weight vector $w$. See [SST (see
https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/pdf/1734566.pdf ), Algorithm 2.3.14 and
Lemma 2.5.10].

Here is [SST (see https://mathscinet.ams.org/mathscinet/pdf/1734566.pdf ),
