+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : b = 2                                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = 2                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : I = ideal(x_1*dx_1*(x_1*dx_1+b), x_1*dx_1*(x_2*dx_2+b),                 |
|         x_2*dx_2*(x_1*dx_1+b), x_2*dx_2*(x_2*dx_2+b))                       |
|                                                                             |
|             2  2                                                      2  2  |
|o3 = ideal (x dx  + 3x dx , x x dx dx  + 2x dx , x x dx dx  + 2x dx , x dx  +|
|             1  1     1  1   1 2  1  2     1  1   1 2  1  2     2  2   2  2  |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     3x dx )                                                                 |
|       2  2                                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : Ideal of W                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : isTorusFixed I                                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = true                                                                    |
